	(title_block
		(title "MP62 port module MOD-C: 1 x USB-C 24P (10G + DP alt) on FPC - fit x6 (C1-C3 as drawn, C4-C6 rotated 180 deg)")
		(date "2026-10-02")
		(rev "A1")
		(company "MP62 I/O - port modules (D-IO16)")
		(comment 1 "JLC FPC 2-layer 0.19 mm (PI 50 um core, Cu 12/12 um), ENIG, coverlay PI 25 + 25 adh.. Stiffeners: FR4 1.0 (B) under the port, FR4 0.6 (B) under the paddle")
		(comment 2 "L1 signals: 90 ohm USB / 100 ohm TMDS diff microstrip (2D FD solve, tools/zsolve.py; TDR coupon), L2 GND (hatched 45 deg in the bend)")
		(comment 3 "Fold: flat as drawn; 180 deg at Bend_Zone so J2 faces DOWN onto the main-board JMn. Pinout = PMI-50 v2 (pmi50.py, plan 4.7.10)")
	)
